<Verse 1>
[E]着迷于你眼睛|zhao mi yu ni yan jing
[Eaug]银河有迹可循|yin he you ji ke xun
[E6]穿过时间的缝|chuan guo shi jian de feng
[E7]隙 它依然真实|xi ta yi ran zhen shi
[A]地 吸引我轨迹|de xi yin wo gui ji [Am6]

<Verse 2>
[E]这瞬眼的光景|zhe shun yan de guang jing
[Eaug]最亲密的距离|zui qin mi de ju li
[E6]沿着你皮肤纹|yan zhe ni pi fu wen
[E7]理 走过曲折手|li zou guo qu zhe shou
[A]臂 做个梦给你|bi zuo ge meng gei ni
[Am]做个梦给|zuo ge meng gei
[E]你 等到看|ni deng dao kan
[C#m7]你银色满际 等到|ni yin se man ji deng dao
[F#m7]分不清季节更替|fen bu qing ji jie geng ti
[B7sus4] 才敢说沉溺|cai gan shuo chen ni

[E] [Eaug] [E6]

<Chorus 1>
